  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the end of three years from the date of this permission.\r\n\r\nReason: In order to comply with the provisions of Section 91 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).\r\n\r\n",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans PL-100, PL-011, PL-010\r\n\r\nReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interest of proper planning.\r\n",
    "Condition : 3 - The use of the fifth-floor roof terrace for filming purposes (Use Class E(g)(iii)) hereby approved shall not take place on more than 50 days in any calendar year (1 January to 31 December).\n\n For the avoidance of doubt, any part of a day during which filming takes place, including associated activities such as set-up, rehearsals and dismantling, shall count as one full day for the purposes of this condition.\n\n\r\n\r\nReason: \nTo ensure that the use remains limited in frequency and intensity, and to safeguard the amenity of adjoining and nearby occupiers, in accordance with Policy A1 of the Camden Local Plan (2017) and Policy D14 of the London Plan (2021)."
  ],
